---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Projects — SlushTec"
  description="VARP and Ashcourt in active development. Permanent residual systems, True Emotion Engine, original-IP dark fantasy. Local-first, fail-forward, adult 18+."
  image="/images/varp-card.jpg"
>
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 pt-14 sm:pt-20 pb-8">
    <p class="text-warm-earth text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4">
      In Development
    </p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold text-white tracking-tight mb-5">Projects</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
      Systems that keep score. Original IP only. Local-first where it matters. No soft resets.
    </p>
    <div class="score-line mt-10 max-w-md"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- VARP -->
  <section id="varp" class="scroll-mt-24 border-t border-surface">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-14 sm:py-20">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-start">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-surface project-visual">
            <img
              src="/images/varp-card.jpg"
              alt="VARP — residual street, permanent ledger"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              width="800"
              height="600"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-white">VARP</h2>
            <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded residual-active bg-warm-earth/15 text-warm-earth border border-warm-earth/40">
              In Development
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-golden-glow text-base mb-6 tracking-wide">
            Virtual Action Role Play · Playable vertical slice
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl">
            A modular, local-first Virtual LARP engine. You act freely inside reactive mini-universes whose inhabitants keep permanent score.
            Features the True Emotion Engine (bias + residue, not transcripts), soul-bound residual systems, bidirectional relationships that can rise or collapse, and original World Packs.
          </p>
          <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-3 text-base text-gray-400 mb-8">
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="text-warm-earth">▸</span> Permanent consequence ledger + Echo</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="text-warm-earth">▸</span> Living Relationship Radar</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="text-warm-earth">▸</span> Soul-bound Journal + Returns pages</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="text-warm-earth">▸</span> True-Name / Soul-Contract rituals</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="text-warm-earth">▸</span> World Clock + absence residual</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="text-warm-earth">▸</span> Annex ⇄ Street loop currently playable</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
            Adult 18+. Original IP only. Local-first (Ollama / ComfyUI optional for art).
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Ashcourt -->
  <section id="ashcourt" class="scroll-mt-24 border-t border-surface bg-surface/20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-14 sm:py-20">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-start">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 order-1 lg:order-none">
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-surface project-visual">
            <img
              src="/images/ashcourt-card.jpg"
              alt="Ashcourt — Hell Rises ritual circle"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              width="800"
              height="600"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-white">Ashcourt — Hell Rises</h2>
            <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface text-gray-400 border border-surface">
              In Development
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-golden-glow text-base mb-6 tracking-wide">
            Original-IP dark fantasy aRPG · Flagship World Pack
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl">
            You claw up from nothing in a living hell of rings, contracts, and reputation.
            Intent-based combat, lasting wounds, true-name contracts, and living infrastructure.
            The proving ground for True Emotion Engine V2 and the first commercial World Pack for VARP.
          </p>
          <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-3 text-base text-gray-400 mb-8">
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="text-warm-earth">▸</span> Intent combat — declare approach; scars persist</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="text-warm-earth">▸</span> Reputation & true-name contracts</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="text-warm-earth">▸</span> Living infrastructure (rings, diplomacy)</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="text-warm-earth">▸</span> Hybrid dialogue (critical + live core cast)</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="text-warm-earth">▸</span> Soft death transforms rather than reloads</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="text-warm-earth">▸</span> Residual humor on repeated failure patterns</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
            Flagship World Pack for VARP. Original IP only. Adult 18+.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
